"Perform an overhead attack with a polearm or staff.  The attack will knock "
"back all targets hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
msgid "Fulcrum Kick"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fulcrum Kick"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"Deliver a powerful flying kick using a polearm as a springboard.  The kick "
"will knock back humanoid targets of similar or smaller size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Coiling Strikes"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Coiling Strikes"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"Perform a quick reach attack with a polearm or staff if you have at least 1 "
"momentum stack.  The attack will heavily scale with perception."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Snap slash"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Snap slash"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"If you dodge an attack with a knife or dagger, you'll counterattack with a "
"quick slash."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Slaying strike"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slaying strike"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"Perform a finishing attack with a knife or dagger when reaching 3 tempo "
"stacks.  The attack will prioritize enemy weak points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
msgid "Vulgar Opening"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vulgar Opening"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have no combat buffs active, perform an opening attack with armor "
"penetration increased by 225% of your strength.  Just hit them with the damn "
"thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Martial technique name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/techniques/techniques.json
msgid "Estocada"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Estocada"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"Perform a quick lunging thrust with a long sword, thrusting sword or "
"quarterstaff.  You must have exactly 1 momentum stack to perform this attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Compound finisher"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Compound finisher"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"If your third attack against the same target coincides with the full combat "
"tempo bonus, you will perform a fast and powerful finishing attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Timed lunge"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Timed lunge"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"Perform a ranged lunge attack with fencing and thrusting swords.  The attack "
"will move you adjacent to the target or move you away from the target if you "
"are already adjacent to them.  You must have exactly 1 momentum stack to "
"perform this attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Charging Tackle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Charging Tackle"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"Your first attack after acquiring at least 3 momentum stacks will be replaced"
" by a shoulder tackle.  The tackle will ground humanoid targets of similar or"
" smaller size and consume all momentum stacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Execution"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Execution"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever you attack a human-sized target with a great axe, great sword or "
"great hammer if the target has less health than the base attack rating of "
"your weapon, you will execute them instead.  Execution attacks ignore armor "
"and will restore 10% of your max stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid "Brutal Execution"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Brutal Execution"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/perk_techniques.json
msgid ""
"You perform executions with such brutality that all minded enemies that "
"witness them will become stunned for 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_perk_ma_level_up"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/leveling.json
msgid "Your experience with martial arts has increased!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_perk_ma_initialize"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/EOC/leveling.json
msgid ""
"Martial Mastery mod is active.  Interact with the \"Practice Martial Arts\" "
"trait from the mutation menu to learn new techniques and perks."
msgstr ""

