"You aren't even trying.\n"
"You clear all combat buffs whenever you wait."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
msgid "Pressure Points"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pressure Points"
#: data/mods/Perk_melee/PERKS/perks.json
